Subject: [PATCH 103/105] POC-29: fewer * chips (N1a: * is never the folder's
 code to lean toward, ordinary drops never roll *, rare drops keep their 1 in
 4), the bench shares the EXP from the start out of the fighters' share (N2a:
 2/3 fighters, 1/3 bench; the Exp. Share item now switches it off), Gen 5
 scaled EXP (N3a); fix: Castform's four-form palette overflowed the picture
 loader (any Castform battle crashed); campaign runs go to the eighth badge

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
